ont/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/plus_jakarta_sans_latin_500_normal-s.p.1evhelic1rxge.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/plus_jakarta_sans_latin_600_normal-s.p.0p6sew1q6gl7s.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/plus_jakarta_sans_latin_700_normal-s.p.1dulefe5e4s81.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/logo.webp\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/02mkr0z8o939x.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/1b-l3oagpuv39.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/11jq0c2_zavac.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4561u0v7ysn3r.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/021sppg0zbt0v.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-2pcc6e_qu_s3g.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0ht-3v40sanoo.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2a2r_ezcb6klj.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1_p0c8_mtfqqv.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/41mnvtr75by45.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><title>Team Utilization Calculator | PYNGYN</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Work out billable utilization across your bench, see what your current rate is worth, and find the revenue upside of hitting your target. Free, no signup. Built for professional-services teams.\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"Nikunj Chugh\"/><meta name=\"creator\" content=\"Nikunj Chugh\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/team-utilization/\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Team Utilization Calculator | PYNGYN\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Measure billable utilization across your team and spot where capacity is being lost. Free, no signup.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/team-utilization/\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"PYNGYN: Clientspace, a standalone branded client portal, and Workspace, a standalone back office for professional-services firms\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"PYNGYN: The operating system for professional-services firms\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Run your firm and every client engagement in one place. The operating system for professional-services firms.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon.png\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-organization\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"legalName\":\"VIMOVI GlobalTech Private Limited\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/logo.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"image\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/icon.png\",\"description\":\"PYNGYN gives every client a branded Client Space (a standalone portal for status, documents, and approvals), with Workspace, the firm's back office for projects, finances, and billable time, available on its own or bundled together.\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://x.com/Pyngyn_Official\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/pyngyn/\",\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Pyngyn_Official/\",\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61584474731354\",\"https://www.youtube.com/@PyngynOfficial\",\"https://instagram.com/pyngyn_official\"],\"contactPoint\":[{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"customer support\",\"email\":\"support@pyngyn.com\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/support\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]},{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"sales\",\"email\":\"sales@pyngyn.com\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/demo\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-website\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#website\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"description\":\"The operating system for professional-services firms. Run your firm and every client engagement in one place.\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:left-4 focus:top-4 focus:z-[200] focus:rounded-lg focus:bg-accent focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-white\">Skip to content</a><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/team-utilization#webpage\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/team-utilization\",\"name\":\"Team Utilization Calculator | PYNGYN\",\"description\":\"Measure billable utilization across your bench and find the revenue upside of hitting target.\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#website\"},\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/team-utilization#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/team-utilization#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Tools\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Team Utilization Calculator\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/team-utilization\"}]},{\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/team-utilization#faq\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does the team utilization calculator measure?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It estimates billable utilization for a services team: the share of your people's working capacity that is billed to clients. It then shows what that utilization is worth in revenue, and the upside of reaching the target you set.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How is utilization calculated?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Capacity per person is hours per week times working weeks per year, after PTO and holidays. Current utilization is the share of that capacity billed to clients. Multiply capacity by utilization and by your billable rate to get revenue, then compare current and target to find the gap.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is a good utilization target?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It varies by firm and role. For client-facing consultants, 70 to 80% is a common healthy range; the rest goes to sales, internal work, learning, and rest. Senior and leadership roles usually carry lower billable targets. Set the target to match how your firm actually runs.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does the consultant-equivalent figure mean?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It converts the gap to your target into whole people. If the firm-wide shortfall equals two consultants' worth of annual capacity, you are effectively employing two billable people you are not yet billing. It is a quick way to feel the size of the gap.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Should I aim for 100% utilization?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Full utilization leaves no room for business development, internal projects, training, or recovery, and it tends to drive burnout and attrition. The calculator deliberately compares against a target you choose, not against 100%.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the calculator free?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, it is free with no signup. Adjust the inputs as many times as you like and copy a summary of the result. To model your firm in detail, book a demo.\"}}]}]}</script><header class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-[100] border-b transition-all duration-300 border-transparent bg-transparent\"><div class=\"wrap flex h-[68px] items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center\" aria-label=\"pyngyn home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"pyngyn\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logo.webp\"/></a><div class=\"hidden h-full lg:flex lg:items-center\"><nav class=\"flex items-center gap-7 text-[15px] text-[#3a3a42]\"><a class=\"py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent\" href=\"/clientspace/\">Clientspace</a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Product<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Solutions<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Resources<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Compare<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button></nav></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/\" class=\"hidden text-[15px] font-semibold lg:inline \">Sign in</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"hidden px-4 py-2.5 lg:inline-flex btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"hidden px-[18px] py-2.5 lg:inline-flex btn btn-primary\">Book a demo</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-lg border lg:hidden border-line bg-white text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"wrap pb-[10px] pt-[140px] text-center\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Free tool</span><h1 class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(34px,5vw,58px)] font-semibold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.025em]\">How much of your team is actually billing?</h1><p class=\"lead mx-auto mt-5\">Bench time, half-staffed projects, and unevenly loaded consultants quietly cap revenue. Measure your billable utilization, then see what hitting target is worth. Free, no signup.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>No signup</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>USD or INR</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Built for services firms</span></div></section><div class=\"pt-12\"><div class=\"wrap pb-[80px]\"><div class=\"grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-[420px_1fr]\"><aside class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-[88px] lg:self-start\"><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Your bench</div><div class=\"inline-flex rounded-full border border-line p-0.5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[12px] font-semibold transition-colors text-muted hover:text-ink\">₹<!-- --> <!-- -->INR</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[12px] font-semibold transition-colors bg-ink text-white\">$<!-- --> <!-- -->USD</button></div></div><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\">How busy is your billable team?</h2><div class=\"mt-5 space-y-5\"><label class=\"block\"><div class=\"mb-1.5 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink\">Billable people</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-muted\">Consultants who bill</span></div><div class=\"relative\"><input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"2000\" step=\"1\" class=\"input \" value=\"12\"/></div></label><label class=\"block\"><div class=\"mb-1.5 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink\">Hours per week</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-muted\">Standard working week</span></div><div class=\"relative\"><input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"80\" step=\"1\" class=\"input \" value=\"40\"/></div></label><label class=\"block\"><div class=\"mb-1.5 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink\">Working weeks / year</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-muted\">After PTO and holidays, often 46 to 48</span></div><div class=\"relative\"><input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"52\" step=\"1\" class=\"input \" value=\"46\"/></div></label><label class=\"block\"><div class=\"mb-1.5 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink\">Average billable rate</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-muted\">What you bill per hour ($)</span></div><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[14px] text-muted\">$</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"2000\" step=\"5\" class=\"input pl-7\" value=\"150\"/></div></label><div><div class=\"mb-1.5 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink\">Current utilization</span><span class=\"rounded-md bg-accent-lt px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold text-accent\">62%</span></div><input type=\"range\" min=\"0.2\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.01\" class=\"h-1.5 w-full cursor-pointer appearance-none rounded-full bg-line accent-accent\" aria-label=\"Current utilization\" value=\"0.62\"/><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[11.5px] leading-snug text-muted\">Share of capacity currently billed to clients.</p></div><div><div class=\"mb-1.5 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink\">Target utilization</span><span class=\"rounded-md bg-accent-lt px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold text-accent\">80%</span></div><input type=\"range\" min=\"0.4\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.01\" class=\"h-1.5 w-full cursor-pointer appearance-none rounded-full bg-line accent-accent\" aria-label=\"Target utilization\" value=\"0.8\"/><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[11.5px] leading-snug text-muted\">A healthy goal for your bench. 70 to 80% is common.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"mt-6 w-full rounded-full border border-line bg-white py-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent\">Reset to defaults</button></div></aside><section class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] border border-line bg-ink p-7 text-white shadow-card lg:p-9\"><div class=\"glow-radial pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.6]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/55\">Your current billable utilization</div><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-end gap-3\"><span class=\"font-display text-[clamp(40px,7vw,68px)] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]\">62<!-- -->%</span><span class=\"mb-2 rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-[12px] font-semibold bg-white/10 text-white/70\">18 pts below your 80% target</span></div><div class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] text-white/65\">Across <!-- -->12<!-- --> <!-- -->people<!-- -->, that is<!-- --> <span class=\"font-semibold text-white\">13,690</span> <!-- -->billable hours a year, worth<!-- --> <span class=\"font-semibold text-white\">$2.1M</span>.</div><div class=\"mt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[12px] text-white/55\"><span>Capacity billed vs target</span><span>Target <!-- -->80<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"relative mt-2 h-3.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/10\"><div class=\"h-full bg-white/85\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-[-3px] bottom-[-3px] w-[2px] bg-accent\" style=\"left:calc(80% - 1px)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-1 text-[12px]\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-white/70\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-white/85\"></span> <!-- -->Currently billed (<!-- -->62<!-- -->%)</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-white/70\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span> Target (<!-- -->80<!-- -->%)</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-[22px] border border-accent/20 bg-accent-lt p-7 shadow-card\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent\">Upside of reaching your target</div><div class=\"mt-3 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><div class=\"font-display text-[clamp(30px,4.5vw,42px)] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink\">$596,160</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[14px] text-muted\">in extra billable revenue per year at <!-- -->80<!-- -->% utilization</div></div><div class=\"sm:border-l sm:border-accent/20 sm:pl-5\"><div class=\"font-display text-[clamp(30px,4.5vw,42px)] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink\">2.2<!-- --> <!-- -->consultants</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[14px] text-muted\">of billable capacity you already employ but are not yet billing</div></div></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted\">Current billable revenue</div><div class=\"mt-2 font-display text-[30px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink\">$2.1M</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[12.5px] text-muted\">13,690 hrs/yr</div></div><div class=\"rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted\">Revenue at target</div><div class=\"mt-2 font-display text-[30px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-accent\">$2.6M</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[12.5px] text-muted\">17,664 hrs/yr</div></div><div class=\"rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted\">Billable hours to find</div><div class=\"mt-2 font-display text-[30px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-amber-600\">3,974 hrs</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[12.5px] text-muted\">2.2 FTE equivalent</div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-[22px] border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted\">How the numbers add up</div><dl class=\"mt-4 divide-y divide-line text-[14px]\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-2.5\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-ink\">Capacity per person</div><div class=\"text-[12px] text-muted\">40 hrs/week × 46 weeks</div></div><div class=\"flex-none tabular-nums font-semibold\">1,840 hrs/yr</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-2.5\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-ink\">Billable per person, now</div><div class=\"text-[12px] text-muted\">24.8 hrs/week × 62% util</div></div><div class=\"flex-none tabular-nums font-semibold\">1,141 hrs/yr</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-2.5\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-ink\">Firm-wide billable, now</div><div class=\"text-[12px] text-muted\">× 12 people</div></div><div class=\"flex-none tabular-nums font-semibold\">13,690 hrs/yr</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-2.5\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">Current billable revenue</div><div class=\"text-[12px] text-muted\">× $150/hour</div></div><div class=\"flex-none tabular-nums font-display text-[17px] font-semibold\">$2,053,440</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-2.5\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-ink\">Firm-wide billable at target</div><div class=\"text-[12px] text-muted\">at 80% utilization</div></div><div class=\"flex-none tabular-nums font-semibold\">17,664 hrs/yr</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-2.5\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-ink\">Revenue at target</div></div><div class=\"flex-none tabular-nums font-semibold\">$2,649,600</div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-2.5\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">Revenue upside at target</div><div class=\"text-[12px] text-muted\">3,974 hrs to find</div></div><div class=\"flex-none tabular-nums font-display text-[17px] font-semibold\">$596,160</div></div></dl><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold transition-all border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-accent hover:text-accent\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"3\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"></rect><path d=\"M3 21V8a2 2 0 012-2h3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg>Copy summary</button><span class=\"text-[12px] text-muted\">Estimates only. Utilization and target are yours to adjust.</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] border border-line bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-lt via-white to-canvas p-7 lg:p-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between\"><div><div class=\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent\">Turn idle capacity into billed work</div><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-display text-[26px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] lg:text-[30px]\">See where your team&#x27;s hours actually go.</h3><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-[540px] text-[15px] text-muted\">In a 30-minute demo we run PYNGYN on a team like yours and show how live status and capacity views surface the bench time that quietly goes unbilled.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book a demo</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a></div></div></div></section></div></div></div><section class=\"section-tight\"><div class=\"wrap max-w-[820px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>The method</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3\">Honest math, your inputs.</h2><div class=\"mt-6 space-y-4 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><p>Utilization is the simplest read on whether a services team is loaded well. The model here is deliberately transparent. Capacity per person is your working hours per week times your working weeks per year, after holidays and time off. Current utilization is the share of that capacity billed to clients, and multiplying by your rate turns hours into revenue.</p><p>The opportunity is measured against a target you set, not against a theoretical 100%. Full utilization is neither realistic nor healthy, since people also sell, learn, run internal work, and rest. The gap between current and target, priced at your rate, is the revenue you could win back by loading the bench more evenly, and it is also expressed as whole consultants of capacity so the size is easy to feel.</p><p>Treat the output as a directional estimate, not a quote. Averages hide a lot: two people at 90% and two at 30% read the same as four at 60%. The point is to make hidden idle capacity visible so you can decide whether it is worth addressing. When you want to model your firm properly,<!-- --> <a href=\"/demo\" class=\"font-semibold text-accent hover:text-accent-dk\">book a demo</a>.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>FAQ</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3\">Questions, answered.</h2><dl class=\"mt-6 divide-y divide-line\"><div class=\"py-5\"><dt class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\">What does the team utilization calculator measure?</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">It estimates billable utilization for a services team: the share of your people&#x27;s working capacity that is billed to clients. It then shows what that utilization is worth in revenue, and the upside of reaching the target you set.</dd></div><div class=\"py-5\"><dt class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\">How is utilization calculated?</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Capacity per person is hours per week times working weeks per year, after PTO and holidays. Current utilization is the share of that capacity billed to clients. Multiply capacity by utilization and by your billable rate to get revenue, then compare current and target to find the gap.</dd></div><div class=\"py-5\"><dt class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\">What is a good utilization target?</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">It varies by firm and role. For client-facing consultants, 70 to 80% is a common healthy range; the rest goes to sales, internal work, learning, and rest. Senior and leadership roles usually carry lower billable targets. Set the target to match how your firm actually runs.</dd></div><div class=\"py-5\"><dt class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\">What does the consultant-equivalent figure mean?</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">It converts the gap to your target into whole people. If the firm-wide shortfall equals two consultants&#x27; worth of annual capacity, you are effectively employing two billable people you are not yet billing. It is a quick way to feel the size of the gap.</dd></div><div class=\"py-5\"><dt class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\">Should I aim for 100% utilization?</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">No. Full utilization leaves no room for business development, internal projects, training, or recovery, and it tends to drive burnout and attrition. The calculator deliberately compares against a target you choose, not against 100%.</dd></div><div class=\"py-5\"><dt class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\">Is the calculator free?</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Yes, it is free with no signup. Adjust the inputs as many times as you like and copy a summary of the result. To model your firm in detail, book a demo.</dd></div></dl></div></div></section><section class=\"section-tight\"><div class=\"wrap max-w-[820px]\"><div class=\"rounded-[22px] border border-accent/30 bg-accent-lt px-7 py-9 sm:px-9\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>From this tool to your firm</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[26px]\">See utilization live, per person, per engagement, in Workspace.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[640px] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">This calculator works from averages you enter by hand. Workspace tracks billable time per person and per engagement automatically, so the idle bench and the overloaded one both show up before quarter-end, not after.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-accent\">Start free trial<!-- --> →</a><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-ghost bg-white\">Book a demo</a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"demo\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white px-7 py-[72px] text-center shadow-card\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-[420px] w-[420px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-accent-lt opacity-70 blur-[80px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"eyebrow relative\">Ready when you are</span><h2 class=\"title relative mx-auto mt-3.5 max-w-[680px] text-[clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px)]\">Stop managing the tool. Start shipping the work.</h2><p class=\"lead relative mx-auto mt-[18px]\">See PYNGYN run a real project in 30 minutes, and let AI handle the project management busywork.</p><div class=\"relative mt-[30px] flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book a demo →</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a></div><p class=\"relative mt-4 text-sm text-muted\">30-minute walkthrough · Tailored to your team · No commitment</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-white pt-16 pb-10 text-sm text-muted\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(5,1fr)]\"><div><a class=\"mb-4 inline-block\" aria-label=\"pyngyn home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"pyngyn\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logo.webp\"/></a><p class=\"max-w-[230px] leading-relaxed\">The operating system for professional-services firms.</p><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.pyngyn.io&amp;hl=en_IN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-xl border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2.5 transition-colors hover:border-accent\" aria-label=\"Get PYNGYN on Google Play\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.6 2.3 13 12 3.6 21.7a1.4 1.4 0 0 1-.6-1.2V3.5c0-.5.2-.9.6-1.2z\" fill=\"#34a853\"></path><path d=\"M16.8 8.6 13 12 3.6 2.3c.4-.3.9-.3 1.4 0l8.8 5z\" fill=\"#ea4335\"></path><path d=\"M16.8 15.4 5 22c-.5.3-1 .3-1.4 0L13 12z\" fill=\"#fbbc04\"></path><path d=\"m16.8 8.6 4 2.3c.7.4.7 1.4 0 1.8l-4 2.7L13 12z\" fill=\"#4285f4\"></path></svg><span class=\"flex flex-col leading-tight\">